const faq=[['How much does it cost to raise a child until 18?','It depends on housing, family income, childcare, education, healthcare, location and inflation. This calculator generates a scenario from your own assumptions rather than a national average.'],['Does this calculator include college?','No. It covers ages 0 through 17 inclusive and excludes college or university costs.'],['Are regional presets official statistics?','No. Regional examples are illustrative placeholders to customize, not official estimates or purchasing-power comparisons.'],['Are costs doubled for two children?','The model multiplies per-child amounts by the number of children. In reality, some costs may be shared, including housing, clothing and childcare discounts.']];
